# Spockify chat wrapper for Mistral 7B.
# Base ollama/mistral is a completion model; in chat it may invent fake User:/Assistant: turns.
# Create: ollama create spockify-mistral-7b -f /modelfiles/mistral-7b.Modelfile
FROM mistral

PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER stop "User:"
PARAMETER stop "\nUser:"
PARAMETER stop "Mistral AI:"
PARAMETER stop "\nMistral AI:"

SYSTEM """You are a helpful assistant. Reply only to the user's actual message.
Do not invent, simulate, or continue with fake "User:" or "Assistant:" dialogue turns.
Keep greetings short and natural."""
